# Framework boundaries

Contracts, policies, budgets and settlement remain framework-neutral. Temporal
is the sole macro runtime; Deep Agents is bounded cognition. SDK objects stay in
adapters. Checkpoints, traces and provider responses are evidence, not authority.

Use exact admitted bindings. Unknown capabilities fail explicitly. Do not add
silent provider fallbacks or competing schedulers. Validate library behavior
against pinned official dependencies. Paid experiments need finite spending approval.
